    "Claude Code and Codex read a saved transcript through the app's own MCP server, so they can split and check terms from the caption editor. They can't do it during transcription, when the captions don't exist yet — that pass falls back to Apple Intelligence or an OpenAI-compatible model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 与 Codex 通过 App 自带的 MCP 服务读取已保存的字幕，因此可以在字幕编辑器中拆分字幕、检查术语。但转写过程中字幕尚未生成，它们无从读取，那一步会改用 Apple 智能或 OpenAI 兼容模型。"
