    },
    "The claude command isn't installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装 claude 命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The codex command isn't installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装 codex 命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine that produced these suggestions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成这些建议的引擎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model decides where a long caption should break — at a clause boundary, never mid-phrase, and never leaving a stub second line. It leaves a caption alone when no split improves it. The length above is the threshold it works to.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由模型决定长字幕在哪里断开——在语义停顿处断句，不会拆散词组，也不会留下过短的第二行。如果拆分没有好处，就保持原样。上面的长度是它参照的阈值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model didn't find anything worth changing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型没有发现需要修改的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note tells the model what this is — \"company name\", \"drug name\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备注告诉模型这是什么——“公司名”“药品名”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The partial video file will be removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除已生成的部分视频文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider returned no phrases.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务未返回任何语句。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The timing fallback re-runs a transcription on another provider when the first returns timings that go backwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当首选服务返回的时间轴出现倒退时，备用服务会用另一服务重新转写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme Color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题颜色"
          }
        }
      }
