    "This permanently deletes all messages in this chat. The composition itself is not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将永久删除此聊天中的所有消息。合成本身不会受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proposal can no longer be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法再读取这条建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This provider didn't return word timings. You can generate approximate ones by spreading the words evenly across the caption.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此服务未返回逐字时间轴。您可以将字词在字幕时长内均匀分布，生成近似时间轴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This transcript has no word timings, so word times will be estimated by splitting each caption's duration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此转写没有逐字时间轴，将按比例拆分每条字幕的时长来估算字词时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will permanently remove the audio file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将永久删除该音频文件。"
