    "Timings are aligned per sentence, not per word. Spot-check them in the retimer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时间轴按句对齐，而非逐字对齐。请在时间轴校准中抽查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timings are estimated from text length. Open the retimer to correct them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
